# Implementation Plan - Capstone Center Add-ons (Real-World Workspace Simulator)

This plan outlines the changes needed to integrate **Student Custom Checklists**, an **Agile Kanban Planner**, and a **Daily Timesheet Log** into the Capstone Project management flow.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> All student data logs (Kanban cards, logged hours, custom checklists) will be nested directly within their unique assigned project slot in the `CapstonePool` model. This keeps all user state unified under a single reference, preventing database fragmentation.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Database & Backend

#### [MODIFY] [CapstonePool.js](file:///c:/Users/vinay/Desktop/V2-Recalio/wemade_logix/mern/wemade_logix_mernstack/server/models/CapstonePool.js)
Extend the mongoose schema to support:
- `progress.customChecklist`: Array of `{ _id, taskName, completed }`
- `planner`: Array of `{ _id, title, description, status, priority, dueDate }`
- `timesheet`: Array of `{ _id, date, hours, description }`

#### [MODIFY] [capstoneController.js](file:///c:/Users/vinay/Desktop/V2-Recalio/wemade_logix/mern/wemade_logix_mernstack/server/controllers/capstoneController.js)
Implement new controllers:
- `addCustomTask` / `toggleCustomTask` / `deleteCustomTask`
- `addPlannerCard` / `updatePlannerCard` / `deletePlannerCard`
- `addTimesheetLog` / `deleteTimesheetLog`

#### [MODIFY] [capstoneRoutes.js](file:///c:/Users/vinay/Desktop/V2-Recalio/wemade_logix/mern/wemade_logix_mernstack/server/routes/capstoneRoutes.js)
Bind new router endpoints:
- `POST /api/capstone/custom-tasks` (Add custom task)
- `PUT /api/capstone/custom-tasks/:taskId/toggle` (Toggle complete status)
- `DELETE /api/capstone/custom-tasks/:taskId` (Remove custom task)
- `POST /api/capstone/planner` (Create Kanban task card)
- `PUT /api/capstone/planner/:cardId` (Update card columns or details)
- `DELETE /api/capstone/planner/:cardId` (Remove card)
- `POST /api/capstone/timesheet` (Add work hours log)
- `DELETE /api/capstone/timesheet/:logId` (Delete work hours log)

